ite up in 1e wasnt very good.<br /> Tho if she stays a scion of Kali im not really worried since Kali has one of the best write up in 2e.<br /> Either way im very curious to see what happens.<br /> <br /> I really like the concept of the ... canon (iconic? OPP made? I dont know how to qualify them) scions and will enjoy reading more about them.<br /> <br /> Edit: damn, sniped haha \ud83d\ude06","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-12T06:40:58-08:00","id":1431963,"title":"","content":"Thank you! This sounds like a great idea and I\u2019ll probably buy it \ud83d\ude0a. I just didn\u2019t know who Annie X was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-12T06:43:05-08:00","id":1431964,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m sorry for being salty earlier. It\u2019s just the name \u201cAnnie X\u201d didn\u2019t sound very Scion-ish and I thought it was like a joke product.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]}